---
// Quiz figure for the Go hardware post, set 07: the three allocator tiers as named in the post.
// It names what each tier holds; it does not say which layout costs the GC more.
// Inline SVG, site tokens only, no <marker>/<defs>/ids.
---
<div class="qfig-gq16at">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 580 290" role="img" aria-label="The three allocator tiers: a per-P mcache, a per-size-class mcentral that holds scan and noscan span sets, and a global mheap with 8 KiB pages inside 64 MiB arenas.">
    <rect x="20" y="12" width="540" height="70" rx="8" class="qfig-gq16at-box" />
    <text x="36" y="36" class="qfig-gq16at-t">1 · mcache</text>
    <text x="36" y="58" class="qfig-gq16at-b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>one per P · spans per size class · no lock</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>mỗi P một cái · span theo size class · không lock</tspan>
    </text>

    <line x1="290" x2="290" y1="82" y2="102" class="qfig-gq16at-wire" />

    <rect x="20" y="102" width="540" height="100" rx="8" class="qfig-gq16at-box" />
    <text x="36" y="126" class="qfig-gq16at-t">
      <tspan data-lang-en>2 · mcentral (one per size class, lock per class)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>2 · mcentral (mỗi size class một cái, lock theo class)</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x="36" y="140" width="240" height="48" rx="5" class="qfig-gq16at-scan" />
    <text x="48" y="161" class="qfig-gq16at-t">scan spans</text>
    <text x="48" y="179" class="qfig-gq16at-b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>objects that hold pointers</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>đối tượng chứa con trỏ</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x="304" y="140" width="240" height="48" rx="5" class="qfig-gq16at-noscan" />
    <text x="316" y="161" class="qfig-gq16at-t">noscan spans</text>
    <text x="316" y="179" class="qfig-gq16at-b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>pointer-free data</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>dữ liệu không có con trỏ</tspan>
    </text>

    <line x1="290" x2="290" y1="202" y2="222" class="qfig-gq16at-wire" />

    <rect x="20" y="222" width="540" height="60" rx="8" class="qfig-gq16at-box" />
    <text x="36" y="246" class="qfig-gq16at-t">
      <tspan data-lang-en>3 · mheap (global lock)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>3 · mheap (lock toàn cục)</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="36" y="268" class="qfig-gq16at-b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>8 KiB pages from 64 MiB arenas · objects over 32 KiB</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>trang 8 KiB từ arena 64 MiB · đối tượng trên 32 KiB</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
</div>

<style>
  .qfig-gq16at { margin: 0; width: 100%; }
  .qfig-gq16at svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 320px; height: auto; }
  .qfig-gq16at text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .qfig-gq16at .qfig-gq16at-t { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-gq16at .qfig-gq16at-b { fill: var(--text-body); }
  .qfig-gq16at-box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .qfig-gq16at-wire { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 2; }
  .qfig-gq16at-scan { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--act-3); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .qfig-gq16at-noscan { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-dasharray: 5 3; }
</style>
